                "text": "Check your quality clauses rather than assuming. Aerospace and nuclear supply agreements frequently require notification of a change in the Responsible Level 3 or approving authority within a stated period, and accreditation schemes carry their own reporting expectations. Notifying voluntarily with an interim designation attached almost always reads better than a customer discovering the change during a surveillance visit."
